config ATM_MPC_NULL_POINTER_DETECTION
	bool "Use MPC for NULL pointer detection in no-TZ mode"
	default y
	depends on !SPE
	help
	  Use TrustZone MPC instead of MPU for NULL pointer detection.
	  This frees up MPU regions for other uses like userspace.

	  When enabled via sysbuild, this option will:
	  - Pass ATM_MPC_NULL_POINTER_DETECTION DTS flag to disable
	    the rom_null_page node
	  - Set CONFIG_NULL_POINTER_EXCEPTION_DETECTION_MPC

	  This option is enabled by default in no-TZ (no SPE) configurations.
